Provenance
----------

The Python source in mioa_core/ and mioa_headless/ was reconciled from the
Mioa shared-core work and from the anti-trace product modules named in each
module docstring (Engine, ControlState, RefStore, ScriptOperations, NativePage,
native_spec and profile). Those modules are MIT-licensed work of the anti-trace
contributors. Source identity of the reconciliation inputs:

  reconcile-desktop-atb-core-20261107T114222Z   mioa-core, mioa-headless
  integration-atb-consumer-20261107T112231Z     migrated headless tests

No ATB CLI, desktop UI, HTTP viewer, Camoufox adapter or Playwright adapter
source is included in this tree. Per-file SHA-256 digests are in
MANIFEST.sha256.

